  // The same file, tgId 4 (ML-KEM-512, decapsulation, VAL):
  // ML-KEM.Decaps_internal of dk and c gives K. In tcIds 76 and 77 (reason
  // "modified ciphertext") re-encryption does not reproduce c, and K is the
  // implicit-rejection key J(z || c); in tcIds 79 and 80 (reason "valid
  // decapsulation") it is the K of the encapsulation.
